[61.250908, "o", "\u001b[32m╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mNationally: 6,072 facilities serve IPV survivors, 10,670 serve trauma survivors.\u001b[0m \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m Same five queries, 17,254 facilities, 1,474,079 edges — refreshed weekly         \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m from a free federal source. Vermont has 27 IPV facilities and none in Spanish.   \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
